Strong positives complete modified function declarations (especially PHP).
Smaller rules recognize familiar compounds headed by rank/status/size words:
major league, chief executive, prime minister, main sequence, and committees.
Some equally familiar compounds, such as primary care and civil society,
have negative signs. These are local phrase rules, not sentiment judgments.
Only the preceding token and a 20-character suffix are retained; document
boundaries clear both. Unrecognized tokens get a near-zero baseline.
