Equality, switch cases and type/name descriptions receive positive values.
Ordinary prose and unrelated code stay close to zero.  Only a short text
suffix is retained, and it is cleared at a document boundary. Magnitudes
are rounded training averages of these contexts. Escaped source quotes
are weaker; a corpus-style title header is a separate strong cue.
