"""A sparse approximation using number and word patterns.

It responds positively when 30 or 31 is completed (less inside a longer
number, more after month names or in :30), to 'thirty', and to short/shortly and
the shortness stems 'kurz' and 'kort'. Several Chinese institutional and
inside/outside terms have a separate negative response. It also covers
'end of', 'heart of', and phrases meaning immediately before, plus an
initial end-of-text marker. Uncovered responses are left at zero.
