"""Approximate a response to fragmented whitespace and document beginnings.

A standalone space after a multi-character horizontal-whitespace token gets
negative activation, weaker later in the document. Smaller rules cover tabs,
odd-length nonbreaking-space chunks, backticks after nonbreaking spaces, and
the GitHub domain suffix (excluding .github subdomains). The first token and
its initial repetitions get coarse offsets by token type, plus a leading
package-keyword exception. Most other positions are zero; most individual
first-word effects are omitted.
"""
import math

